From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: feuristic build <build@feuristic.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 07:31:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feuristic: UI menus with titles and embedded French
 translations
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- select_menu: up to 32 items (MAX_MENU_ITEMS), optional `title`; on
  caesar it is a titled carousel (left = previous, right = next, both =
  select) and, when `cancel` is given, returns CANCELLED from the first
  item (back).
- Translations: the French blob generated at build time from
  core/translations/fr.json is embedded in the firmware image
  (build.rs → OUT_DIR/feuristic_fr.bin) and selected at runtime with
  trezortranslate.set_embedded_french(); the flash assets area is never
  read, so no translation is ever loaded from the host.

Feuristic-Rationale: spec §9 (two-button navigation, FR/EN built in,
no translation loaded by host software).

